# The portrait graphics, in the order they are placed from start to end:
# the lower halves of banks $CA-$D0 (tools/stream_layout.py). Each NAME is
# gfx/portraits/NAME.png (80x64 assembled face + mouth frames), packed to
# NAME.4bpp by tools/portrait_pack.py and compressed to NAME.4bpp.lz. Entries
# are the portrait data IDs that use it (PortraitData... in
# PortraitGraphicPointers.csv).
